		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Watery, elfish, white-haired fey who plays enchanting songs on their faerie harp. Enjoys drowning mortals.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 11, <strong>HP</strong> 19, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 slam +0 (1) or kiss, <strong>MV</strong> near (swim), <strong>S</strong> +0, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +1, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 4</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Beguile</strong>. Fossegrim can enchant one mortal within double near who hears him, CHA 15+ or charmed for 1d6 hours.</p><p></p><p><strong>Drown</strong>. Touch one willing creature, CON 15+ or fill lungs with water. Immediately begin suffocating, go to 0 HP with a death timer of 1.</p><p></p><p><strong>Invisible</strong>. Turn invisible in water. Can sing and play music while invisible.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
